  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">중1 생물다양성 및 생물분류체계 관련한 수업!<br>[교과연계 서울대공원 동물원 체험학습]<br><br>1. 각 반 별로 조사할 동물 분배하고<br>네이버 스마트렌즈+perplexity 활용하여<br>자신이 맡은 동물의 계~종까지 조사 안내하기</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/14c40221fc7d42025a1e35efb349db111988bf7e\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2400\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/14c40221fc7d42025a1e35efb349db111988bf7e\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c9980cc953283ec783b825dfe1adc975ec07ba6a\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2400\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c9980cc953283ec783b825dfe1adc975ec07ba6a\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6155b717aa2f04ed713023bbbd9379386a38b665\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2400\" style=\"width:33.33%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6155b717aa2f04ed713023bbbd9379386a38b665\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2. 동물원 체험학습가서 조사한 것 올리게 하기<br>[각 사육장의 환경까지 조사하도록!]</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/403396fc99b9fafdf541b0048254f0c473a2ae59\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2400\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/403396fc99b9fafdf541b0048254f0c473a2ae59\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/acc670fcf0878626ff74ee4382c413fd22a081ef\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2400\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/acc670fcf0878626ff74ee4382c413fd22a081ef\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/565da13e1f172abd01791fc55b5f4dc3c64abd3e\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2400\" style=\"width:33.33%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/565da13e1f172abd01791fc55b5f4dc3c64abd3e\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">3. 체험학습 이후 수업시간에<br>개인 디벗+Canva 공동작업으로<br>동물원 생태지도 제작</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7cd65e82c9b27ff9fed5f3987e89adb98b204471\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7cd65e82c9b27ff9fed5f3987e89adb98b204471\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"660\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">원래는 이렇게 빈칸으로 지도를 주면,<br>학생들이 디벗(갤럭시 탭)에 samsung note로<br>동물 카드를 이미지로 만들어 넣음!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92782effbb550ac799d6b08c0cc0e226679ca92b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92782effbb550ac799d6b08c0cc0e226679ca92b\" data-origin-width=\"6000\" data-origin-height=\"3375\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">1학년 8반 예시!<br>자세히 보면 학생들이 적은 동물 카드 내용이 있음!</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c58544d36a443140bff4f439a2d696357bb8f85b\" data-file-name=\"1746070592036.png\" data-file-size=\"10743161\" data-mimetype=\"image/png\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DF1n%26dataid%3D852%26fileid%3D10%26regdt%3D20250501131230&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fc58544d36a443140bff4f439a2d696357bb8f85b')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">1746070592036</span><span class=\"type\">.png</span></div><div class=\"size\">10.25MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1ee6966bd0e93b17c8d53dc0a4d26d743a421bc5\" data-file-name=\"1746070593571.png\" data-file-size=\"9386791\" data-mimetype=\"image/png\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DF1n%26dataid%3D852%26fileid%3D9%26regdt%3D20250501131230&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F1ee6966bd0e93b17c8d53dc0a4d26d743a421bc5')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">1746070593571</span><span class=\"type\">.png</span></div><div class=\"size\">8.95MB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">(이건 자세히 보실 분들을 위한 파일)</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
